          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Security notice.** GNOME Web renders pages with `libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0`, which is pinned to WebKitGTK **2.44** \u2014 a series upstream no longer issues security fixes for. Every WebKitGTK advisory since the 2.46 branch is unapplied.\n\nThe pin exists because 2.46+ need C++23 features the iOS Clang 14 toolchain does not have. Until that lane moves, this browser visits untrusted sites with a known-vulnerable engine.\n\nUse it for casual browsing, not for signing in to accounts or handling anything sensitive."
